.TH ECHO "1" "April 2026" "PiggyOS" "User Commands"

.SH NAME
echo \- display a line of text

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B echo
[\fI\,OPTION\/\fR]... [\fI\,STRING\/\fR]...

.SH DESCRIPTION

.PP
Echo the STRING(s) to standard output.

.SH OPTIONS

.TP
.B \-n
omit the trailing newline

